{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "012yus_401_2_4_012_01_09_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:48dfe26cf8739904a1f8d4aae714e792af2a5622aec739b32749ac04b062c083",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:012yus_401_2_4_012_01_09_a:2_4_012_01_09_a:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:37ba79b9a7177aca8772d4c36001d413ae6ed031370ee50b7bbff2446ed6df06",
      "text": "监督！现在方便说话吗？\n前阵子啊，我和享介去游乐园了哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:012yus_401_2_4_012_01_09_a:2_4_012_01_09_a:cmd-000008:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d4cbf911863fd2d83d961db55a724d6515ab6ab1f96020b65df8da818e7a2eaa",
      "text": "享介听了我带回来的见闻，\n说他也想去了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:012yus_401_2_4_012_01_09_a:2_4_012_01_09_a:cmd-000010:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:194c9568884ceee9eee7e4e8153f32bf4e168d78fe08ee595d7ec7c0e16d8010",
      "text": "我们一开园就冲了进去，\n把所有的游乐设施都给制霸了一遍哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:012yus_401_2_4_012_01_09_a:2_4_012_01_09_a:cmd-000012:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:543465e71e0bbb62858c30e7dc2c921fb4e6f035fd847d4f2887fb8203d496c6",
      "text": "光是听你说\n就觉得很有趣！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:012yus_401_2_4_012_01_09_a:2_4_012_01_09_a:cmd-000015:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a6a9becf04adf86bd1a29b920c95c6f4f2d03eb35e0fcfc8e78c457e3d813e0e",
      "text": "嗯！尽情玩到了深夜哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:012yus_401_2_4_012_01_09_a:2_4_012_01_09_a:cmd-000017:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5a7e1f320b2a7652a150cb5fbbc7b40e357394b8f878b0a595ab4a3ce9f4fef1",
      "text": "在摊位上吃东西，玩游乐设施，\n然后再吃东西……太棒啦♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:012yus_401_2_4_012_01_09_a:2_4_012_01_09_a:cmd-000018:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:91753603d9fde8d3eae881687453d3e10eedf2b852c96cbe0c0476237798178d",
      "text": "玩得很尽兴呢",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:012yus_401_2_4_012_01_09_a:2_4_012_01_09_a:cmd-000021:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4ac41412611ba23826de36e060b963c025f984332a1f0f952a3beebc58d0b395",
      "text": "嘿嘿，对吧！\n然后啊，我就想到了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:012yus_401_2_4_012_01_09_a:2_4_012_01_09_a:cmd-000023:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:214de4785e33f9509e12abe96f4e6679a98435047385ff414a13102a7b66f138",
      "text": "什么时候要是事务所的大家能一起去游乐园，\n岂不是太棒了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:012yus_401_2_4_012_01_09_a:2_4_012_01_09_a:cmd-000025:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:91007e17cfb2498a2323dae5d3768c975ae3a27cef6e800646e13994ef9fe032",
      "text": "甚至给它整个包场！\n监督你觉得怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:012yus_401_2_4_012_01_09_a:2_4_012_01_09_a:cmd-000027:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5b11f35994eaa281e6ead6d4d1b6b7f94ca04f714868bbe33716c84345b06f1a",
      "text": "我觉得\n非常棒！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:012yus_401_2_4_012_01_09_a:2_4_012_01_09_a:cmd-000028:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d6323e9c2ce376e5f5c7a1642338ec4a54b39d8eb95190f09c828fdc8b4058fe",
      "text": "感觉会超级好玩！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:012yus_401_2_4_012_01_09_a:2_4_012_01_09_a:cmd-000031:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:95b0441f10c3869693e727f32a788a6d6277e97b714556243f8ca2e6c5ba0e08",
      "text": "对吧！大家一起从早玩到晚，\n光是想象一下就超级兴奋啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:012yus_401_2_4_012_01_09_a:2_4_012_01_09_a:cmd-000033:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7b7bf8ca42851dd5cf2d1db27cc3ecfc023a006f091d1cea39a868f20a794992",
      "text": "虽然有那么多人可能很难实现，\n但要是哪天能实现就好了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:012yus_401_2_4_012_01_09_a:2_4_012_01_09_a:cmd-000035:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:83b68f15faf71e6aa9ec3c03554b6774ef40f04e90775ab81adcac7697c07830",
      "text": "监督也一起去游乐园玩吧！\n那就这样！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
